    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8702" root="حكل" body-key="H">
    
      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">احكل عَلَىَّ الخَبَرُ</span></b>  <i>The information was
dubious, confused,</i> or <i>vague, to me;</i> (Zj, S, K;)
as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَكَلَ</span></b> , (K,) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">احتكل</span></b> : (S, * K, * TA:)
and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">احكل الأَمْرُ</span> (Msb) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">احتكل</span></b>  <i>The affair,</i>
or <i>case, was dubious,</i> or <i>confused,</i> (Msb, TA,)
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَلَيْهِ</span> <i>to him.</i> (TA.)

